ad-Core 2.0GHz CPU, 4X\u2026\"]\ue201**\n\nIntel N5105 \u00b7 4GB DDR4 \u00b7 Dual 2.5GbE\n\nExcellent Plex transcoding, four NVMe slots, and expandable RAM. Particularly attractive for media enthusiasts.\n\n\\$406.99 at Best Buy\n\n\ue200url\ue202View product\ue202https://www.bestbuy.com/product/asustor-as5402t-2-bay-nas-intel-quad-core-2-0ghz-cpu-4x-m-2-nvme-ssd-slots-2x2-5gbe-ports-4gb-ddr4-ram-for-gaming-unknown/J3ZYH5HVCF/sku/12871066?utm_medium=feed&fs=tog3hp&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn247212product1\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**3\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn247212product1\",\"QNAP TS-264 2-Bay High-Performance Desktop NAS. Intel 4C/4T \u2026\"]\ue201**\n\nIntel N5095 \u00b7 8GB RAM \u00b7 Dual 2.5GbE\n\nMature NAS platform, PCIe expansion, and solid hardware transcoding. Good for Plex plus Docker applications.\n\n\\$489.00 at newegg.com\n\n\ue200url\ue202View product\ue202https://www.newegg.com/qnap-ts-264-2-bay-intel-celeron-n5095-diskless-system/p/N82E16822099151?item=N82E16822099151&utm_medium=ai_search&utm_campaign=ais_openai_product_feed&negg_topt=1015&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"Synology DiskStation DS224+ two bay NAS front product\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**4\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"product\",\"Synology DiskStation DS224+\"]\ue201**\n\nIntel J4125 \u00b7 2GB RAM \u00b7 Dual 1GbE\n\nBest for easy setup, reliability, and Synology's polished DSM operating system. Older and slower hardware, but still capable of Plex hardware transcoding.\n\nTypical guide price: around \\$300\u2013\\$350\n\nSources: \ue200cite\ue202turn247212search2\ue202turn247212search5\ue202turn247212search7\ue202turn247212search4\ue201\\. Prices exclude hard drives and may change.\n\n## Quick comparison\n\n| Model | 4K Plex transcoding | Networking | Best feature |\n|--------|--------|--------|--------|\n| UGREEN DXP2800 | Very good | 2.5GbE | Newer Intel N100 |\n| ASUSTOR AS5402T | Very good | Dual 2.5GbE |  |"},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls/4","o":"replace","v":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/4uewMD5hS365x00d-dGO3kuuu9JxQ__EiQsoY2LHtc6ZDmp7qOg_mu0I12Qvlecc3b-vQ3cL-R86Jx15GQwSzxLFqplW-pXf5w8ZnXM0D45fuSOdGOOGl3OxYo7QjzIIRsbJmkv1-hHNkvi2sGZzAy7MQx640aXUfrNMzTYvp_A"},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls/5","o":"replace","v":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/vrPe4dsgIiU9SaBgUvvCtPEYAbnAKYQNvj3HF8nEew7qPTU1sugdKIwNh5ZIMQwrAZFDFtV7O2x1m1DGcyweLvauMYr9BRxYRL4DZhDPqZnBFFIJ4ZzKngysFfwnBBpdgibwR1GtitY8uz1Kb2GGh03BYFxw5otUrkuJzqK_k9M"},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls/6","o":"replace","v":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/2uWTvzTuLeJrRT8Yk21XYTldjGRK7TKgSldiuk61CYZs6SPx3nHfn2osFWNsv6gr6WttitOfHLqZj_jNT1khtefsIpOHx-BHNdpeWk3xqhvybc01aHQ8u4WFlYHoPLksLmv0E9ABLLsrSjKdS_IjcW13Iu5sYAoHzdbtFw0DZms"},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls/7","o":"replace","v":"https://www.newegg.com/qnap-ts-264-2-bay-intel-celeron-n5095-diskless-system/p/N82E16822099151?item=N82E16822099151&utm_medium=ai_search&utm_campaign=ais_openai_product_feed&negg_topt=1015&utm_source=chatgpt.com"},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls/8","o":"replace","v":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/dX9YzHUw-KxsASb0mZXT5AKQkHr8N5gmKXE6bDPhb2-eyOxZYDmjqaBBDevf20Bex6YWp5DYiDCeOmtTXKjtamAIj0orDOUR1eymlwbGqXZvAAs5lrgJQn0v-Lt_7hfN"},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls/9","o":"replace","v":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/kODRoDqScRcObxK70G5qkQbVBJRBBqSKjIppc3KO3O5592yScr1W6VzZj6__QenZZ7d1ekaXci2Y5UADP6VvjG3crGJLxckff008U048U70wT-Zag7LG2L26krk6L7v4"},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls/10","o":"replace","v":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/rdVsuIux0uEPBd9ac2dnZ05SJLj6pk5bWU-mlBVhu1frYv3M4OushMzMLjkt8Rd7jVOSxFr0Eb4eFqkLBVrny4VIt5NvoMRP2iwZgvdJw4H1fh0o5FWeZ5fqZxucKSgU"},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls/11","o":"replace","v":"https://altex.com/products/synology-ds224-